Create New Group 
-------------------
  -addgroup command is used to create new group.
  -sudo permission is required to execute addgroup command. 
  -Sudo(Super user do)
  -Root user(Sudo permision)
  -ec2-user(Normal user with sudo permision).
  -Example: 
          sudo addgroup group1 
