  How to create user
  ------------------
  -When ever create a user in linux bu default they will be inside some group.
   if you not give group-name also by default inside some default group.
   syntax:
           adduser username
           eg.- sudo adduser -ingroup groupname username
  -If you create a user without group system will create a default group.
  -Eg- sudo adduser username [new group,groupname=username]

  Create user code
  ----------------
  ubuntu@ip-172-31-15-180:~$ sudo adduser --ingroup group1 user1
  fatal: The user `user1' already exists.
  ubuntu@ip-172-31-15-180:~$ sudo deluser user1
